{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906460/extras/729a07a3800021b1a4ab40f3c590e4c9.avif?t=1769352336\" width=1042 height=400 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d The world once soared through the skies on wings of steel\u2026 until everything changed.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When disaster struck, the lucky ones bought property on remote islands, now the last remaining safe havens. Humanity clings to survival, scattered and struggling, with fragile network infrastructure barely held together by a few.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But life... goes on. Even in ruin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906460/extras/beeef1fe5d1e9aacfcc5ebcdf74de1d9.webp?t=1769352336\" width=221 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906460/extras/4bc972fbbc7d9d9456bbe92be97f97a1.poster.avif?t=1769352336\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906460/extras/4bc972fbbc7d9d9456bbe92be97f97a1.webm?t=1769352336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906460/extras/4bc972fbbc7d9d9456bbe92be97f97a1.mp4?t=1769352336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2708\ufe0f You\u2019ve found an abandoned <strong>plane</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's old. It's broken. But it\u2019s yours. Scavenge the world for parts. <strong>Rebuild it</strong>. Fly between islands... or maybe <strong>beyond</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906460/extras/cf5c920cab5a867b6f97bf980b083872.webp?t=1769352336\" width=176 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906460/extras/44fa2cfb2132d59d0fd917f0273c85ad.poster.avif?t=1769352336\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906460/extras/44fa2cfb2132d59d0fd917f0273c85ad.webm?t=1769352336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906460/extras/44fa2cfb2132d59d0fd917f0273c85ad.mp4?t=1769352336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcbb In a world where real interaction is rare, the internet is your lifeline</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow? Yes. Fragile? Definitely. But essential.<br>Your connection to the world is digital and vital:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order plane parts online</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat with clients and maybe friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Browse post-apocalyptic websites</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your email</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay your internet bills\u2026 if you want to stay connected</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906460/extras/bfe0eb03e49e42f06a72aa9a79b03c90.webp?t=1769352336\" width=239 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906460/extras/09e3e18b16d086e705103f7f5d41970